ill"></use><path class="RatingStar__fill"></path></svg></span></span></div><span class="Text Text__body3"><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/4934777172">August 29, 2022</a></span></section><section class="ReviewText"><section class="ReviewText__content" dir="auto"><div class="TruncatedContent" tabindex="-1"><div class="TruncatedContent__text TruncatedContent__text--large" tabindex="-1" data-testid="contentContainer"><span class="Formatted">This is a Cowboy Romance, and this is the 5th book in the Texas Cattleman's Club: Ranchers and Rivals series. I have not read any of the other books in this series, but I think this book can be read as a standalone without any problem. This book gets very steamy at times. I did really like the characters in this book, and I also liked the storyline. I was kindly provided an e-copy of this book by the publisher (Harlequin Desire) or author (Yahrah St. John) via NetGalley, so I can give an honest review about how I feel about this book. I want to send a big Thank you to them for that.</span></div><div class=""></div></div></section></section><section class="ReviewCard__tags"><ul class="CollapsableList"><span tabindex="-1"><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/96556777?shelf=arc-copy" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium"><span class="Button__labelItem">arc-copy</span></a><span tabindex="-1"> </span><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/96556777?shelf=cowboy-romance-small-town-romance" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium"><span class="Button__labelItem">cowboy-romance-small-town-romance</span></a><span tabindex="-1"> </span><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/96556777?shelf=harlequin" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium"><span class="Button__labelItem">harlequin</span></a></span><span tabindex="-1"></span> <div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium" aria-label="Show all items in the list"><span class="Button__labelItem">...more</