:"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.dCk9qrlm87EHRhSE","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.dCk9qrlm87EHRhSE"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/1127488?shelf=read"},"taggings":[{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"2022-books-read","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/1127488?shelf=2022-books-read"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"ebook","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/1127488?shelf=ebook"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"category-romance","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/1127488?shelf=category-romance"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"first-reads-review-copies","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/1127488?shelf=first-reads-review-copies"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"romance","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/1127488?shelf=romance"}}],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/5023460544"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.KUxTLgtWv3HihwuRXjiCiQ":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.KUxTLgtWv3HihwuRXjiCiQ","creator":{"__ref":"User:1127488"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1726906892522,"createdAt":1664793152186,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1664812369617,"text":"Good book. Everyone in the TCC heard Natalie's confession of her feelings for Jonathan when her online chat with her best friend accidentally went live at the club's Fourth of July bash. Since then, she's been avoiding him and everyone else as best she can. Finally, she decides to leave town for a while and let the gossip die down. She checks into a Galveston resort and looks forward to a week of peace.\u003cbr /\u003e \u003cbr /\u003eJonathan has been aware of Natalie's crush for years, but with a bad marriage and divorce under his belt, he has no intention of ever marrying again. He blames himself for the failure of his marriage, so he keeps his liaisons superficial and spends all of his time working on the family ranch. When his worried parents force him to take a vacation, Jonathan finds himself checking into the same resort where Natalie is staying.\u003cbr /\u003e \u003cbr /\u003eI enjoyed seeing the relationship develop between Natalie and Jonathan. Natalie is a curvy woman who was bullied as a child because of her weight and still has self-esteem issues. When Jonathan looks at her, he sees a sexy woman he'd like to spend time with. Neither can deny the fiery attraction they feel. After one night together, Jonathan proposes a week-long fling to end when they return to Royal. Natalie agrees because she will take what she can get but suspects that her heart will pay the price.\u003cbr /\u003e \u003cbr /\u003eNatalie was right. The more time they spent together, the deeper her feelings for Jonathan grew. Throughout the week, he made it clear that marriage would never be an option, but she couldn't help hoping he'd change his mind. Some scenes between them fueled that hope. Even though Jonathan often feels things with Natalie that he's never felt before, he suppresses those feelings, sure they wouldn't last. He stubbornly sticks to his \"no marriage\" mantra until Natalie finally believes him.\u003cbr /\u003e \u003cbr /\u003eOn their return to Royal, they attempt to return to their previous lives, but both are miserable. Resuming their affair in secret seems to be the only cure. Once again, Natalie risks her heart, but she can't stay away from the man she loves. Jonathan may be cracking under the onslaught of his feelings, but his fears continue to hold him back. When Jonathan's ex-wife confronts Natalie, it brings her fears to a head, and she pulls back. I loved seeing Jonathan finally see the light with the help of his brother Jayden. I loved his emotional reunion with Natalie, and his big moment at the end was a neat tribute to their beginning.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e#netgalley","rating":4,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A256JPEVY302AG\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.dCk9qrlm87EHRhSE\"}}"},"likeCount":1,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:19269022":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":19269022,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1463064434i/19269022._UY200_CR33,0,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":1,"textReviewsCount":1200,"name":"Belinda","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/19269022-belinda","contributor":null,"id":19269022},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A5LZ5EJPUCHFF":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A5LZ5EJPUCHFF"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A5LZ5EJPUCHFF\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.mXWb5Nql_0UsY0Ip\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A5LZ5EJPUCHFF","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A5LZ5EJPUCHFF"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.mXWb5Nql_0UsY0Ip","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.mXWb5Nql_0UsY0Ip"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/19269022?shelf=read"},"taggings":[],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/4797537214"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.WFXfUt3UvKLtC4eGWrMlTA":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.WFXfUt3UvKLtC4eGWrMlTA","creator":{"__ref":"User:19269022"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1659281344390,"createdAt":1655822065944,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1655822406676,"text":"Jonathan Lattimore had his heart and soul crushed when his wife divorced him. He will not get married ever again he tells anyone that will listen.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eNatalie Hastings declared her love for him at the last TCC party for all to hear.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eSince than Jonathan avoids Natalie.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eNatalie soon is going on a vacation in Galveston and guess who she runs into there at the same place she is staying. See his parents sent him there on vacation!\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThey butt heads as usual t first but they decide to see where the week will take them!\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThe chemistry leaps off the pages with these two!\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eCan hurt over ones past be overcome by love of a beautiful woman? This is a must read in this series.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThey are still trying to find info for the two families to keep their ranches.","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A5LZ5EJPUCHFF\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.mXWb5Nql_0UsY0Ip\"}}"},"likeCount":1,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:14619244":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":14619244,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1681004279i/14619244._UX200_CR0,0,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":17,"textReviewsCount":492,"name":"Aisha","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/14619244-aisha","contributor":null,"id":14619244},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A3TP8LBM4L5153":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A3TP8LBM4L5153"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A3TP8LBM4L5153\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.mXWb5Nql_0UsY0Ip\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A3TP8LBM4L5153","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A3TP8LBM4L5153"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://b